              직영 골조 시스템까지 통합 엔지니어링 역량을 바탕으로 타협 없는 안전과 최적의 공기를 실현합니다.
            </p>

            <div className="flex flex-wrap gap-4">
              <a 
                href="#projects" 
                className="px-7 py-3.5 bg-[#e30613] hover:bg-red-700 text-white rounded font-bold text-sm transition-all flex items-center gap-2 shadow-xl shadow-red-900/30"
              >
                주요 프로젝트 실적 <ChevronRight className="w-4 h-4" />
              </a>
              <a 
                href="#technology" 
                className="px-7 py-3.5 bg-slate-900/80 hover:bg-slate-800 text-slate-200 border border-slate-700 rounded font-bold text-sm transition-all"
              >
                핵심 엔지니어링 기술
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>

          {/* 핵심 재무·안전 지표 카드 (PDF 7p, 9p 데이터) */}
          <div className="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-4 mt-16 pt-10 border-t border-slate-800/80">
            <div className="bg-slate-900/50 backdrop-blur border border-slate-800 p-5 rounded-lg">
              <div className="text-xs text-slate-400 font-semibold mb-1">나이스 기업신용평가</div>
              <div className="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-white font-mono">BBB<span className="text-amber-400">0</span></div>
              <p className="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">안정적 재무건전성 매년 상승</p>
            </div>

            <div className="bg-slate-900/50 backdrop-blur border border-slate-800 p-5 rounded-lg">
              <div className="text-xs text-slate-400 font-semibold mb-1">차입금 의존도</div>
              <div className="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-white font-mono">0<span className="text-amber-400">%</span></div>
              <p className="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">무차입 경영 & 현금결제 100%</p>
            </div>

            <div className="bg-slate-900/50 backdrop-blur border border-slate-800 p-5 rounded-lg">
              <div className="text-xs text-slate-400 font-semibold mb-1">건설안전보건평가</div>
              <div className="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-white font-mono">SA<span className="text-amber-400">2</span></div>
              <p className="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">업계 상위 2.4% 최상위 수준</p>
            </div>

            <div className="bg-slate-900/50 backdrop-blur border border-slate-800 p-5 rounded-lg">
              <div className="text-xs text-slate-400 font-semibold mb-1">중대재해 / 사망사고</div>
              <div className="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-black text-white font-mono">Zero</div>
              <p className="text-[11px] text-slate-400 mt-1">설립 이래 중대사고 0건 유지</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      {/* 3. PROJECTS */}
      <section id="project" className="py-28 bg-slate-900 border-t border-slate-800">
        <div className="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
          <div className="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-end justify-between mb-12">
            <div>
              <span className="text-[#e30613] font-mono text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase">Major References</span>
              <h2 className="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white mt-2">주요 프로젝트 실적</h2>
            </div>

            {/* 필터 탭 */}
            <div className="flex gap-2 mt-6 md:mt-0 overflow-x-auto pb-2 md:pb-0">
              {[
                { id: 'all', label: '전체' },
                { id: 'bio', label: '바이오/제약' },
                { id: 'rnd', label: 'R&D/연구소' },
                { id: 'general', label: '일반건축' },
              ].map(tab => (
                <button
                  key={tab.id}
                  onClick={() => setActiveFilter(tab.id)}
                  className={`px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs font-bold transition-all ${
                    activeFilter === tab.id
                      ? 'bg-[#e30613] text-white shadow-md'
                      : 'bg-slate-800 text-slate-300 hover:bg-slate-700'
                  }`}
                >
                  {tab.label}
                </button>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>

          <div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
            {filteredProjects.map((p) => (
              <div 
                key={p.id}
                className="bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800/80 rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:border-slate-700 transition-all duration-300 group hover:-translate-y-1.5 shadow-lg"
              >
                <div className="h-52 relative overflow-hidden">
                  <img 
                    src={p.image} 
                    alt={p.title} 
                    className="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-500 group-hover:scale-105"
                  />
                  <div className="absolute top-4 left-4 bg-slate-900/90 backdrop-blur px-3 py-1 rounded text-[11px] font-bold text-amber-400">
                    {p.categoryName}
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div className="p-6">
                  <div className="text-xs font-bold text-[#e30613] mb-1">{p.client}</div>
                  <h3 className="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-4 line-clamp-1 group-hover:text-amber-400 transition-colors">
                    {p.title}
                  </h3>
                  <div className="pt-4 border-t border-slate-800/80 text-xs text-slate-400 flex justify-between items-center">
                    <span>{p.scope}</span>
                    <ArrowUpRight className="w-4 h-4 text-slate-500 group-hover:text-white" />
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
