      <section id="technology" className="py-28 bg-slate-950 border-t border-slate-800">
        <div className="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6">
          <div className="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16">
            <span className="text-[#e30613] font-mono text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase">Core Technology</span>
            <h2 className="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white mt-2">엔지니어링 전문 기술</h2>
            <p className="text-slate-400 text-sm mt-3">
              설계부터 3D BIM 시뮬레이션, 공조 제어 및 토목 직영 시공까지 독보적인 원스톱 기술력을 제공합니다.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div className="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
            <div className="bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 p-8 rounded-xl hover:border-slate-700 transition-all">
              <div className="w-12 h-12 bg-red-950/60 border border-red-800/40 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-[#e30613] mb-6">
                <ShieldCheck className="w-6 h-6" />
              </div>
              <h3 className="text-lg font-bold text-white mb-2">GMP & HACCP 플랜트</h3>
